    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mullery O’Gara are delighted to present an exceptional opportunity to acquire a ready to go site with Full Planning Permission for two Three Bed Semi Detached homes of approx. 118sq m (1,270 sq ft).\r\n\r\nThe spaciously designed home will have an open plan kitchen and dining room, a lounge, a downstairs w.c and understairs storage. On the first floor there are two bedrooms, the main bedroom ensuite, a home office and a family bathroom. On the second floor the third bedroom completes the accommodation.\r\n\r\nFernhill Road is perfectly situated with every amenity imaginable is located on your doorstep including numerous well established Terenure and Templeogue Colleges, Our Lady's Grove, St. Pius X Junior School, Holy Spirit and St. Pauls. Local and larger shopping facilities in the villages of Terenure, Kimmage, Crumlin and Templeogue.\r\n\r\nThe area has a host of recreational facilities in the vicinity with Greenhills Park, Bushy Park & Tymon Park on your doorstep. The area is well serviced by frequent and dependable bus routes and the property also enjoys the added bonus of easy access to the M50 motorway network."
      },
